# Maestro backend (`src-tauri`)

Before implementing or fixing behavior here:

1. Read **[docs/backend-workflow.md](../../docs/backend-workflow.md)** (skill paths, `cargo test`, when to run `npm run build`).
2. Follow the OpenSpec capability **backend-dev-workflow**: [openspec/changes/backend-superpowers-workflow/specs/backend-dev-workflow/spec.md](../../openspec/changes/backend-superpowers-workflow/specs/backend-dev-workflow/spec.md).
3. Use Superpowers skills from the repo (via Skill tool or file): **test-driven-development**, **verification-before-completion**, **systematic-debugging** for failures, **using-superpowers** at task start.
4. Prefer **small, descriptive commits** per finished sub-task.

Do not claim tests pass or work is complete without running the verification commands listed in `docs/backend-workflow.md`.
